# CMake's, and the SDK's copy of itself that it generates into it. The glob rather than `build/`
# because there is one directory per core — `build-riscv/` is the Hazard3 configuration, and a
# second personality of the chip is not a second checkout.
build*/

# The pico-sdk, when somebody clones it in here rather than pointing PICO_SDK_PATH elsewhere. It is
# 81 MB and belongs to Raspberry Pi.
pico-sdk/
